template's overflow check, tools/check_overflow.js, is copied unchanged to
.baseline/check_overflow.js and pinned there; it is not served either. The template's card
builder is copied unchanged to .baseline/build_card.js, and its Inter fonts, with
inter-LICENSE.txt, to .baseline/card-fonts/; they are pinned there and are not served. This
site's own files, not pinned, are .baseline/site-card.toml, the card builder's data file, and
